{
  "info": {
    "name": "Oficina Mecânica — So PosTech API v2",
    "description": "Collection atualizada com fluxo automático de status, controle de estoque e relatórios.\n\n## Setup rápido\n1. **Autenticação → Obter token** (salva `access_token` automaticamente)\n2. Operadores disponíveis (senha `senha12345`): `atendente`, `mecanico`, `estoquista`, `admin_ops`\n3. Dados demo: `docker compose exec web python manage.py seed_demo`\n\n## Fluxo da OS\n`Recebida` → PATCH diagnóstico → `EmDiagnostico` (auto) → incluir itens → POST orçamento → `AguardandoAprovacao` (auto) → enviar → aprovar → `EmExecucao` (auto) → `Finalizada` → `Entregue` (baixa estoque)\n\n## Variáveis da collection\nSalvas automaticamente pelos scripts de teste: `cliente_id`, `veiculo_id`, `os_id`, `servico_id`, `peca_id`, `orcamento_id`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cliente_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "veiculo_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "servico_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "peca_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "os_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orcamento_id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obter token (login)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    const d = pm.response.json();",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', d.access);",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', d.refresh);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"atendente\",\n  \"password\": \"senha12345\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/token/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Renovar token",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "    const d = pm.response.json();",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', d.access);",
                "    if (d.refresh) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', d.refresh);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/token/refresh/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuários",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/health/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuário",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"novo_operador\",\n  \"email\": \"novo@oficina.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha12345\",\n  \"name\": \"Novo Operador\",\n  \"type\": \"atendente\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar usuários (admin)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalhar usuário",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users/{{user_id}}/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Meu perfil",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/profile/" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cadastros",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Clientes",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Listar clientes",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/clientes/" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Criar cliente",
              "event": [{
                "listen": "test",
                "script": {
                  "type": "text/javascript",
                  "exec": [
                    "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cliente_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                    "}"
                  ]
                }
              }],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"cpf_cnpj\": \"529.982.247-25\",\n  \"nome\": \"João da Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"joao@email.com\",\n  \"telefone\": \"11999998888\",\n  \"endereco\": \"Rua das Flores, 100 - São Paulo/SP\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/clientes/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Detalhar cliente",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/clientes/{{cliente_id}}/" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Atualizar cliente",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"telefone\": \"11988887777\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/clientes/{{cliente_id}}/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Excluir cliente",
              "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/clientes/{{cliente_id}}/" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Veículos",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Listar veículos",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/veiculos/" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Criar veículo",
              "event": [{
                "listen": "test",
                "script": {
                  "type": "text/javascript",
                  "exec": [
                    "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set('veiculo_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                    "}"
                  ]
                }
              }],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"placa\": \"ABC1D23\",\n  \"marca\": \"Fiat\",\n  \"modelo\": \"Uno\",\n  \"ano\": 2018,\n  \"cliente\": {{cliente_id}}\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/veiculos/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Detalhar veículo",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/veiculos/{{veiculo_id}}/" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Atualizar veículo",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"observacao\": \"Revisão pendente\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/veiculos/{{veiculo_id}}/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Excluir veículo",
              "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/veiculos/{{veiculo_id}}/" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Serviços",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Listar serviços",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/servicos/" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Criar serviço",
              "event": [{
                "listen": "test",
                "script": {
                  "type": "text/javascript",
                  "exec": [
                    "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set('servico_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                    "}"
                  ]
                }
              }],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Troca de óleo\",\n  \"descricao\": \"Troca de óleo e filtro\",\n  \"preco\": \"180.00\",\n  \"tempo_execucao\": 45,\n  \"ativo\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/servicos/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Detalhar serviço",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/servicos/{{servico_id}}/" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Atualizar serviço",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"preco\": \"195.00\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/servicos/{{servico_id}}/"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Excluir serviço",
              "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/servicos/{{servico_id}}/" }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Estoque",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar peças",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pecas/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Alertas — estoque abaixo do mínimo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pecas/alertas/",
            "description": "Retorna peças com quantidade_disponivel < estoque_minimo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar peça",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('peca_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Filtro de óleo\",\n  \"descricao\": \"Filtro universal 1.0 a 1.6\",\n  \"preco\": \"35.00\",\n  \"quantidade\": 25,\n  \"quantidade_reservada\": 0,\n  \"estoque_minimo\": 5\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pecas/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalhar peça",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pecas/{{peca_id}}/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar peça",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantidade\": 30\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pecas/{{peca_id}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Excluir peça",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/pecas/{{peca_id}}/" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ordens de Serviço",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar OS",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/",
            "description": "Operadores veem todas. Cliente logado (com cliente.usuario vinculado) vê só as suas."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Abrir OS",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('os_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"descricao\": \"Motor fazendo barulho ao ligar\",\n  \"cliente\": {{cliente_id}},\n  \"veiculo\": {{veiculo_id}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalhar OS",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/{{os_id}}/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar diagnóstico (auto → EmDiagnostico)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"diagnostico\": \"Correia do alternador desgastada — recomendada troca\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/{{os_id}}/",
            "description": "Sem enviar status: ao preencher diagnostico com OS Recebida, status muda automaticamente para EmDiagnostico."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Transitar status manualmente",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"Finalizada\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/{{os_id}}/",
            "description": "Sequência: Recebida → EmDiagnostico → AguardandoAprovacao → EmExecucao → Finalizada → Entregue. Reparo adicional: EmExecucao → AguardandoAprovacao."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Excluir OS",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/{{os_id}}/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Itens de Serviço",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Listar itens de serviço",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/itens-servico/" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Incluir serviço na OS",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"ordem_servico\": {{os_id}},\n  \"servico\": {{servico_id}},\n  \"quantidade\": 1\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/itens-servico/",
                "description": "preco_unitario congelado do catálogo — não enviar no body."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Remover item de serviço",
              "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/itens-servico/1/" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Itens de Peça",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Listar itens de peça",
              "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/itens-peca/" }
            },
            {
              "name": "Incluir peça na OS (reserva estoque)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"ordem_servico\": {{os_id}},\n  \"peca\": {{peca_id}},\n  \"quantidade\": 2\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/itens-peca/",
                "description": "Reserva estoque automaticamente. Retorna 400 se estoque insuficiente."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Remover item de peça (libera reserva)",
              "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/itens-peca/1/" }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orçamentos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar orçamentos",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Gerar orçamento (auto → AguardandoAprovacao)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orcamento_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                "}"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ordem_servico\": {{os_id}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/",
            "description": "Soma itens pendentes, congela valor_total e, se OS estiver EmDiagnostico, muda automaticamente para AguardandoAprovacao."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalhar orçamento",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/{{orcamento_id}}/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Enviar orçamento",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/{{orcamento_id}}/enviar/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Aprovar orçamento (auto → EmExecucao)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/{{orcamento_id}}/aprovar/",
            "description": "Aprova o orçamento e move a OS automaticamente para EmExecucao."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Recusar orçamento",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/{{orcamento_id}}/recusar/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Relatórios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Tempo médio de execução",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/relatorios/tempo-medio-execucao/",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "relatorios", "tempo-medio-execucao", ""]
            },
            "description": "Média de (data_finalizacao - data_inicio_execucao) das OS concluídas. Filtros opcionais: ?de=2026-01-01T00:00:00&ate=2026-12-31T23:59:59"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fluxo Completo (Runner)",
      "description": "Execute esta pasta em ordem com o Collection Runner após o seed_demo. Salva IDs automaticamente entre os passos.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1 — Login",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('Login OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "const d = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', d.access);"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"atendente\",\"password\":\"senha12345\"}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/token/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2 — Abrir OS",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('OS criada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('os_id', pm.response.json().id);"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"descricao\": \"Barulho no motor\",\n  \"cliente\": 1,\n  \"veiculo\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3 — Registrar diagnóstico",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('EmDiagnostico', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('EmDiagnostico'));"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"diagnostico\":\"Correia desgastada\"}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/{{os_id}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4 — Incluir serviço",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"ordem_servico\":{{os_id}},\"servico\":1,\"quantidade\":1}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/itens-servico/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5 — Incluir peça",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"ordem_servico\":{{os_id}},\"peca\":1,\"quantidade\":1}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/itens-peca/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6 — Gerar orçamento",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('orcamento_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                "pm.test('AguardandoAprovacao', () => {",
                "    pm.sendRequest({",
                "        url: pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') + '/api/ordens-servico/' + pm.collectionVariables.get('os_id') + '/',",
                "        header: { Authorization: 'Bearer ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('access_token') }",
                "    }, (err, res) => {",
                "        pm.expect(res.json().status).to.eql('AguardandoAprovacao');",
                "    });",
                "});"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"ordem_servico\":{{os_id}}}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7 — Enviar orçamento",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/{{orcamento_id}}/enviar/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "8 — Aprovar orçamento",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('EmExecucao', () => {",
                "    pm.sendRequest({",
                "        url: pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') + '/api/ordens-servico/' + pm.collectionVariables.get('os_id') + '/',",
                "        header: { Authorization: 'Bearer ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('access_token') }",
                "    }, (err, res) => {",
                "        pm.expect(res.json().status).to.eql('EmExecucao');",
                "    });",
                "});"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": { "method": "POST", "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orcamentos/{{orcamento_id}}/aprovar/" }
        },
        {
          "name": "9 — Finalizar OS",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"status\":\"Finalizada\"}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/{{os_id}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10 — Entregar OS (baixa estoque)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"status\":\"Entregue\"}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/ordens-servico/{{os_id}}/"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
